{"t": 1794118650.152893, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "[checkout] PaymentGatewayErrors (AG-7731) \u2014 root cause identified, fix ready.\n\nCause: gateway API 2026-11 enforces \"strict amounts\". checkout/gateway.py sent the charge amount as a decimal euro value (12.34), but the gateway now requires an integer in minor units (cents), so charges were rejected with 400 invalid_amount \u2014 38% gateway 4xx rate since 07:41 UTC.\n\nFix: charge_payload() now sends amount as int(round(amount_eur * 100)) with currency EUR (12.34 -> 1234). Verified locally.\n\nNext: deploy checkout and watch the gateway 4xx rate; the alert should clear once the new payload is live."}, "ok": true}
